<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Jan PPI rises 3.6 pct - government.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Jan PPI rises 3.6 pct - government.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's producer price index (PPI) rose 3.6 percent in January on the year, up from a 3.5 percent year-on-year rise a year earlier, Ministry of Finance and Economy figures showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>					   Jan     Dec 96     Jan 96</p>
<p>    PPI (pct, yr-on-yr)	    +3.6     +3.5	+3.5</p>
<p>    PPI (pct, month-to-month)    +1.0     +0.4	+0.9</p>
<p>    PPI (base=1990)		 122.7    121.5     118.4</p>
<p>The ministry said the producer price index (PPI) rose 3.5 percent in 1996, against 3.4 percent in 1995.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5645</p>
</text>
